  m_Name: SagawaKaito
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::CharacterInfo
  characterName: Sagawa Kaito
  description: 'A young man with the one and only goal to care for the family that
    his parents had worked so hard to build. He studies long hours to maintain his
    good grades with a part-time job on the side to alleviate his single mother''s
    financial burdens. He''s not someone that likes to spend time messing around,
    nor does he want anyone else''s pity. He needs to stay focused to keep everything
    from falling apart. Unfortunately for him, one girl would become his biggest
    distraction: Takasu Haruko.'
